# faq-chatbot — service & credential checklist
#
# The export contains NO credential blocks and no $env references: n8n
# stores credentials in its own vault, so this file is a checklist of what
# to connect — it is not read by the workflow. Every value below is empty
# or an obvious placeholder; never commit real secrets.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Credentials to create in n8n (Credentials -> New), then attach on the nodes
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Google Sheets — 9 nodes: Load FAQ answers, Log question or lead,
#   Read unanswered log, Append FAQ proposals, Create FAQ spreadsheet,
#   Write FAQ tab, Write Unanswered tab, Write Leads tab,
#   Write FAQ-Pending tab.
#   n8n credential type: Google Sheets OAuth2 (or Service Account)
GOOGLE_SHEETS_CREDENTIAL=

# Gmail — 2 nodes: Notify owner, Owner weekly digest.
#   n8n credential type: Gmail OAuth2
GMAIL_CREDENTIAL=

# OpenAI — 2 nodes: Answer from FAQ only, Draft FAQ entries (gpt-4o-mini).
#   n8n credential type: OpenAI (API key from platform.openai.com)
OPENAI_API_KEY=

# Not credentialed — needs no entry here:
#   "Website visitor chat" is n8n's hosted Chat Trigger. Activate the
#   workflow and copy the public chat URL it exposes; no key required.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Node-level placeholders to replace inside workflow.json
# (both live in the "Workflow Config" Code node — one edit point)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Printed by Lane D after you press play on "Create FAQ spreadsheet":
SHEET_ID=PASTE_SPREADSHEET_ID_HERE

# Where gap/lead alerts and the Monday digest are sent:
OWNER_EMAIL=owner@example.com

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Live vs demo — there is no env switch
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# The "Live write?" IF node reads $json.live on each item:
#   - demo turns from "Demo visitor turns" carry live:false -> they reach
#     "Demo: record gap or lead" (Code) instead of the Sheets/Gmail writes
#   - real chat turns get live:true in "Build FAQ prompt" -> real sheet
#     writes and owner emails
# To go live: attach the 3 credentials above, paste SHEET_ID + OWNER_EMAIL
# into "Workflow Config", activate the workflow.
# The weekly lane (Monday 09:00) and the Lane D setup lane are
# production-only — they always use the credentials.
